{"id":"privado","lemma":"privado","pos":"adj","rank":1149,"glosses":["private, privy (e.g. a privy council)","deprived, deprived of, denied, bereft (usually followed by de)","unlisted (e.g. phone number)"],"ipa":"/pɾiˈbado/","forms":{"feminine":"privada","masculinePlural":"privados","femininePlural":"privadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-privado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso es privado.","en":"That's private.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441169","words":[null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Me gustaría hablar contigo en privado.","en":"I'd like a word with you in private.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687749","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"with you"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Ese es su sitio web privado.","en":"That's his private website.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78297","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"web site"]]},{"text":"Él contrató a un detective privado.","en":"He hired a private investigator.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645535","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to contract","l":"contratar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"detective"},null]},{"text":"Preferiría hablar contigo en privado.","en":"I'd prefer to speak to you in private.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353357","words":[{"g":"to prefer","l":"preferir"},{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"with you"},{"g":"in / on"},null]}]}